<template><main class="container page-shell prose-page"><span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span><h1>Pet essentials, edited down.</h1><p class="lead">NORDPAWS is being built around a simple idea: pet products can be useful without making your home feel cluttered.</p><h2>Fewer, better choices</h2><p>We focus on everyday problems — hair on the sofa, muddy paws, messy travel and rushed feeding routines — then select products that solve them simply.</p><h2>Sweden first</h2><p>The launch is designed around Swedish customers, SEK pricing, clear delivery information and straightforward returns. Expansion comes after the local experience works well.</p><h2>Transparent by design</h2><p>Before any product is sold, supplier details, safety information, delivery expectations and return handling must be verified. Products that cannot meet those standards do not go live.</p></main></template>
